WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A German request reaches the cleaner's workspace.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Today the call starts in a browser; the phone connection comes later.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
A new tentative booking appears in Needs review.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The cleaner opens the request and checks the appointment.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The address, service and unknown price are clear before a decision.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Confirm moves the booking to Upcoming.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.000
The confirmed request remains visible in the cleaner's inbox.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
It also appears in Schedule as an appointment.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
A real app capture shows the verified confirmed state.
